<title>USA: USDA ups Turkey GSM-102 credit line by $30 mln.</title>
<headline>USDA ups Turkey GSM-102 credit line by $30 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Wednesday said it boosted Turkey's GSM-102 credit guarantee line by $30 million to $130 million for fiscal year 1997.</p>
</text>
